<title>GERMANY: EU may export 25 mln tonnes of grain 96/97 - Toepfer.</title>
<headline>EU may export 25 mln tonnes of grain 96/97 - Toepfer.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union grain exports in the 1996/97 season may total 25 million tonnes, short of a 32.3 million tonne limit on subsidised exports under GATT, German trader Alfred C Toepfer said in a monthly market report.</p>
<p>The GATT limit includes 19.2 million tonnes of wheat, including flour, but excludes two million tonnes of food aid.</p>
<p>Toepfer cited difficult marketing conditions in the world market.</p>
<p>The EU in 95/96 exported 18 million tonnes of grain.</p>
</text>
